{"strongs": "H4994", "word": "נָא", "translit": "na", "root": "מתן", "morph": "H:Intj", "pos": "particle of entreaty", "gloss": "I (we) pray, now", "definition": "I. נָא particle of entreaty or exhortation I (we) pray, now (enclitic) (Syriac , ; compare Ethiopic veni, age! Di § 160. 1 Lex:675 Kö ii. 244 ); — attached: 1. to the imperative, especially in colloquial style, when it expresses an entreaty or admonition, as Gen 12:13 אִמְרִינָֿא say, I pray , Gen 13:9 נָא מֵעָלַי הִפָּרֶדֿ , v Gen 13:14 שָׂאנָֿא עֵינֶיךָ , Gen 15:5 הַבֶּטנָֿא השׁמימה , Gen 24:2 + often, Num 20:10 שׁמעונֿא המוֺרים , Judg 13:4 ; Judg 16:6 ; Judg 16:10 ; Judg 16:28 ; Judg 18:5 , etc., Isa 1:18 ; Isa 5:3 ; Amos 7:2 ; Amos 7:5 rarely in a command, Gen 22:2 ; Isa 7:3 ). Ironically, in a challenge, Isa 47:12 ; Job 40:10 . Once anomalously attached to a substantive, or (accents) prefixed to a verb, Num 12:13 אֵ֕ל נָא֛ רְָפא נָא֖ ( Ew § 246 a Di אַלנָֿא ; see 3 b ). 2. to the perfect with waw consecutive, in a precative sense ( Dr § 119 δ ) Gen 40:14 . 3. to the imperfect, when leave is asked, or a prayer or desire expressed; \\ \\ a. in 1 person, especially with ה cohortative, Gen 19:8 אוציאהנֿא let me, I pray , bring out, v Gen 19:20 אִמָּֽלְטָהנָּֿא שָׁ֑מָּה , Gen 24:12 הַקְרֵהנָֿא לְפָנַי v Gen 24:14 הַטִּינָֿא v Gen 24:17 v Gen 24:23 v Gen 24:43 v Gen 24:45 ; Gen 25:30 ; Gen 32:12 ; Gen 32:30 + often, Exod 3:18 נלכהנֿא let us go, I pray , Num 20:17 ; Isa 5:5 and in self-deliberation, Gen 18:21 ארדהנּֿא I will go down, now ! Exod 3:3 אסורהנּֿא ואראה I will turn aside, now , and see, 2Sam 14:15 ; Song 3:2 ; Isa 5:1 with אַל Job 32:21 . \\ \\ b. in 2 person, with אַל , in deprecation, Gen 18:3 אלנֿא תעבר מעל עבדך , Gen 19:7 ; Gen 47:29 ; Num 10:31 , etc.; hence elliptical אלנֿא do not, I pray , (do this,) Gen 19:18 ; Gen 33:10 ; Num 12:13 Ew Di . \\ \\ c. in 3 person, Gen 18:4 יֻקַּחנָֿא let there be brought, I pray , Gen 26:28 ; Gen 33:14 ; Gen 44:18 ; Gen 44:33 , etc., 2Sam 14:11 ; 2Sam 14:12 ; 2Sam 14:17 ; 1Kgs 17:21 ; 2Kgs 2:9 ; Ps 7:10 ; Ps 118:2 ; Ps 118:3 ironically Isa 19:12 ; Isa 47:13 , or defiantly Jer 17:15 where is the word of J.? יָבוֺא נָא ; with אַל , Gen 13:8 אַלנָֿא תְהִי מְרִיבָה , Gen 18:30 אַלנָֿא יִחַר לַאדֹנָי , Gen 37:27 ; Num 12:12 . 4. joined to conjunctions and interjections: \\ \\ a. [ אָהּנָֿא , contracted] אָ֫נָּא . \\ \\ b. אַלנָֿא see above 3 b, c. c. אִםנָֿא , especially in the phrase אם נא מצאתי חן בעיניך , used by one craving a favourable hearing Gen 30:27 ; Gen 33:10 ; Judg 6:17 ; 1Sam 27:5 , and with נא repeated in the request itself Gen 18:3 ; Gen 47:29 ; Gen 50:4 ; Exod 33:13 ; Exod 34:9 otherwise Gen 24:42 . \\ \\ d. הִנֵּהנָֿא behold, I pray , craving a favourable consideration of the fact pointed to by הִנֵּה , and of the request founded upon it (with which נא is often repeated), Gen 12:11 ; Gen 16:2 ; Gen 18:27 ; Gen 18:31 ; Gen 19:2 ; Gen 19:8 ; Gen 19:19 ; Gen 19:20 ; Gen 27:2 ; Judg 13:3 ; Judg 19:9 ; 1Sam 9:6 ; 1Sam 16:15 ; 2Sam 13:24 ; 2Kgs 2:16 ; 2Kgs 2:19 ; 2Kgs 4:9 +, Job 13:18 ; Job 33:2 ; Job 40:15 ; Job 40:16 . \\ \\ e. ( לנו ) אוֺינָֿא לי Woe, now , to me (us) ! Jer 4:31 ; Jer 45:3 ; Lam 5:16 . feminine אַיֵּהנָֿא where, pray ? Ps 115:2 . \\ \\ g. נֶגְדָּהנָּֿא , peculiarly, Ps 116:14 ; Ps 116:18 my vows to J. I will perform, נגדהנֿא לכלעֿמו O that (it may be) before all his people ! II. נָא adjective see ניא .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4909')\">BDB4909</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4994')\">H4994</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4908')\">BDB4908</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4910')\">BDB4910</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>נָא</bdbheb> <b>particle of entreaty</b> or <b>exhortation</b> <highlightword>I (we) pray, now</highlightword> (enclitic) (Syriac <placeholder3132/>, <placeholder3133/>; compare Ethiopic <placeholder3134/> <highlight>veni, age!</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di<sup>§ 160. 1 Lex:675</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kö')\">Kö<sup>ii. 244</sup></lookup>); — attached: <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> to the imperative, especially in colloquial style, when it expresses an entreaty or admonition, as <ref ref=\"Gen 12:13\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(1,12,13)\">Gen 12:13</ref> <bdbheb>אִמְרִינָֿא</bdbheb> say, <highlight>I pray</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Gen 13:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,13,9)\">Gen 13:9</ref> <bdbheb>נָא מֵעָלַי הִפָּרֶדֿ</bdbheb>, v<ref ref=\"Gen 13:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,13,14)\">Gen 13:14</ref> <bdbheb>שָׂאנָֿא עֵינֶיךָ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Gen 15:5\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(1,15,5)\">Gen 15:5</ref> <bdbheb>הַבֶּטנָֿא השׁמימה</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Gen 24:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,2)\">Gen 24:2</ref> + often, <ref ref=\"Num 20:10\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(4,20,10)\">Num 20:10</ref> <bdbheb>שׁמעונֿא המוֺרים</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Judg 13:4\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(7,13,4)\">Judg 13:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 16:6\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,6)\">Judg 16:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 16:10\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,10)\">Judg 16:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 16:28\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,28)\">Judg 16:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 18:5\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(7,18,5)\">Judg 18:5</ref>, etc., <ref ref=\"Isa 1:18\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,18)\">Isa 1:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 5:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,3)\">Isa 5:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 7:2\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(30,7,2)\">Amos 7:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 7:5\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(30,7,5)\">Amos 7:5</ref> rarely in a command, <ref ref=\"Gen 22:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,22,2)\">Gen 22:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 7:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,7,3)\">Isa 7:3</ref>). Ironically, in a challenge, <ref ref=\"Isa 47:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,47,12)\">Isa 47:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 40:10\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(18,40,10)\">Job 40:10</ref>. Once anomalously attached to a substantive, or (accents) prefixed to a verb, <ref ref=\"Num 12:13\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(4,12,13)\">Num 12:13</ref> <bdbheb>אֵ֕ל נָא֛ רְָפא נָא֖</bdbheb> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew<sup> § 246 a</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup> <bdbheb>אַלנָֿא</bdbheb>; see <b>3 b</b>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> to the perfect with <highlight>waw</highlight> consecutive, in a precative sense (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr<sup>§ 119</sup></lookup> <grk>δ</grk>) <ref ref=\"Gen 40:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,40,14)\">Gen 40:14</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> to the imperfect, when leave is asked, or a prayer or desire expressed; <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> in 1 person, especially with <bdbheb>ה</bdbheb> cohortative, <ref ref=\"Gen 19:8\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,8)\">Gen 19:8</ref> <bdbheb>אוציאהנֿא</bdbheb> let me, <highlight>I pray</highlight>, bring out, v<ref ref=\"Gen 19:20\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,20)\">Gen 19:20</ref> <bdbheb>אִמָּֽלְטָהנָּֿא שָׁ֑מָּה</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Gen 24:12\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,12)\">Gen 24:12</ref> <bdbheb>הַקְרֵהנָֿא לְפָנַי</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Gen 24:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,14)\">Gen 24:14</ref> <bdbheb>הַטִּינָֿא</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Gen 24:17\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,17)\">Gen 24:17</ref> v<ref ref=\"Gen 24:23\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,23)\">Gen 24:23</ref> v<ref ref=\"Gen 24:43\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"43\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"43\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,43)\">Gen 24:43</ref> v<ref ref=\"Gen 24:45\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"45\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"45\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,45)\">Gen 24:45</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 25:30\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(1,25,30)\">Gen 25:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 32:12\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(1,32,12)\">Gen 32:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 32:30\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(1,32,30)\">Gen 32:30</ref> + often, <ref ref=\"Exod 3:18\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(2,3,18)\">Exod 3:18</ref> <bdbheb>נלכהנֿא</bdbheb> let us go, <highlight>I pray</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Num 20:17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(4,20,17)\">Num 20:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 5:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,5)\">Isa 5:5</ref> and in self-deliberation, <ref ref=\"Gen 18:21\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(1,18,21)\">Gen 18:21</ref> <bdbheb>ארדהנּֿא</bdbheb> I will go down, <highlight>now !</highlight> <ref ref=\"Exod 3:3\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(2,3,3)\">Exod 3:3</ref> <bdbheb>אסורהנּֿא ואראה</bdbheb> I will turn aside, <highlight>now</highlight>, and see, <ref ref=\"2Sam 14:15\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(10,14,15)\">2Sam 14:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Song 3:2\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(22,3,2)\">Song 3:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 5:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,1)\">Isa 5:1</ref> with <bdbheb>אַל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 32:21\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(18,32,21)\">Job 32:21</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> in 2 person, with <bdbheb>אַל</bdbheb>, in deprecation, <ref ref=\"Gen 18:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,18,3)\">Gen 18:3</ref> <bdbheb>אלנֿא תעבר מעל עבדך</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Gen 19:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,7)\">Gen 19:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 47:29\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(1,47,29)\">Gen 47:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 10:31\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,31)\">Num 10:31</ref>, etc.; hence elliptical <bdbheb>אלנֿא</bdbheb> do not, <highlight>I pray</highlight>, (do this,) <ref ref=\"Gen 19:18\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,18)\">Gen 19:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 33:10\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(1,33,10)\">Gen 33:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 12:13\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(4,12,13)\">Num 12:13</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> in 3 person, <ref ref=\"Gen 18:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,18,4)\">Gen 18:4</ref> <bdbheb>יֻקַּחנָֿא</bdbheb> let there be brought, <highlight>I pray</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Gen 26:28\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(1,26,28)\">Gen 26:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 33:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,33,14)\">Gen 33:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 44:18\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(1,44,18)\">Gen 44:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 44:33\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(1,44,33)\">Gen 44:33</ref>, etc., <ref ref=\"2Sam 14:11\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(10,14,11)\">2Sam 14:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 14:12\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(10,14,12)\">2Sam 14:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 14:17\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(10,14,17)\">2Sam 14:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 17:21\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(11,17,21)\">1Kgs 17:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 2:9\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(12,2,9)\">2Kgs 2:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 7:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,7,10)\">Ps 7:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 118:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"118\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"118\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,118,2)\">Ps 118:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 118:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"118\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"118\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,118,3)\">Ps 118:3</ref> ironically <ref ref=\"Isa 19:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,19,12)\">Isa 19:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 47:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,47,13)\">Isa 47:13</ref>, or defiantly <ref ref=\"Jer 17:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,17,15)\">Jer 17:15</ref> where is the word of J.? <bdbheb>יָבוֺא נָא</bdbheb>; with <bdbheb>אַל</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Gen 13:8\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(1,13,8)\">Gen 13:8</ref> <bdbheb>אַלנָֿא תְהִי מְרִיבָה</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Gen 18:30\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(1,18,30)\">Gen 18:30</ref> <bdbheb>אַלנָֿא יִחַר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>לַאדֹנָי</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Gen 37:27\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(1,37,27)\">Gen 37:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 12:12\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(4,12,12)\">Num 12:12</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> joined to conjunctions and interjections: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> [<bdbheb>אָהּנָֿא</bdbheb>, contracted] <bdbheb>אָ֫נָּא</bdbheb>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <bdbheb>אַלנָֿא</bdbheb> see above <b>3 b, c. c.</b> <bdbheb>אִםנָֿא</bdbheb>, especially in the phrase <bdbheb>אם נא מצאתי חן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>בעיניך</bdbheb>, used by one craving a favourable hearing <ref ref=\"Gen 30:27\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(1,30,27)\">Gen 30:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 33:10\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(1,33,10)\">Gen 33:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 6:17\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,17)\">Judg 6:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 27:5\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(9,27,5)\">1Sam 27:5</ref>, and with <bdbheb>נא</bdbheb> repeated in the request itself <ref ref=\"Gen 18:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,18,3)\">Gen 18:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 47:29\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(1,47,29)\">Gen 47:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 50:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,50,4)\">Gen 50:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 33:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,33,13)\">Exod 33:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 34:9\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(2,34,9)\">Exod 34:9</ref> otherwise <ref ref=\"Gen 24:42\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"42\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"42\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,42)\">Gen 24:42</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> <bdbheb>הִנֵּהנָֿא</bdbheb> behold, <highlight>I pray</highlight>, craving a favourable consideration of the fact pointed to by <bdbheb>הִנֵּה</bdbheb>, and of the request founded upon it (with which <bdbheb>נא</bdbheb> is often repeated), <ref ref=\"Gen 12:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,12,11)\">Gen 12:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 16:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,16,2)\">Gen 16:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 18:27\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(1,18,27)\">Gen 18:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 18:31\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(1,18,31)\">Gen 18:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 19:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,2)\">Gen 19:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 19:8\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,8)\">Gen 19:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 19:19\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,19)\">Gen 19:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 19:20\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,20)\">Gen 19:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 27:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,27,2)\">Gen 27:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 13:3\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(7,13,3)\">Judg 13:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 19:9\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(7,19,9)\">Judg 19:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 9:6\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(9,9,6)\">1Sam 9:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 16:15\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(9,16,15)\">1Sam 16:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 13:24\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(10,13,24)\">2Sam 13:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 2:16\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(12,2,16)\">2Kgs 2:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 2:19\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(12,2,19)\">2Kgs 2:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 4:9\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(12,4,9)\">2Kgs 4:9</ref> +, <ref ref=\"Job 13:18\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(18,13,18)\">Job 13:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 33:2\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(18,33,2)\">Job 33:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 40:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(18,40,15)\">Job 40:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 40:16\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(18,40,16)\">Job 40:16</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> (<bdbheb>לנו</bdbheb>) <bdbheb>אוֺינָֿא לי</bdbheb> Woe, <highlight>now</highlight>, to me (us) ! <ref ref=\"Jer 4:31\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(24,4,31)\">Jer 4:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 45:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,45,3)\">Jer 45:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lam 5:16\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(25,5,16)\">Lam 5:16</ref>. <b>feminine</b> <bdbheb>אַיֵּהנָֿא</bdbheb> where, <highlight>pray ?</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 115:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"115\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"115\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,115,2)\">Ps 115:2</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>g.</b> <bdbheb>נֶגְדָּהנָּֿא</bdbheb>, peculiarly, <ref ref=\"Ps 116:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"116\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"116\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,116,14)\">Ps 116:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 116:18\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"116\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"116\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(19,116,18)\">Ps 116:18</ref> my vows to J. I will perform, <bdbheb>נגדהנֿא לכלעֿמו</bdbheb> <highlight>O that</highlight> (it may be) before all his people ! </p></div><hr><p>II. <bdbheb>נָא</bdbheb> <b>adjective</b> see  <bdbheb><reflink>ניא</reflink></bdbheb>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 12:13", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 12, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Gen 13:9", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 13, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Gen 13:14", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 13, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Gen 15:5", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 15, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Gen 24:2", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 24, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Num 20:10", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 20, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Judg 13:4", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 13, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Judg 16:6", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 16, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Judg 16:10", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 16, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Judg 16:28", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 16, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Judg 18:5", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 18, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Isa 1:18", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 1, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Isa 5:3", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 5, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Amos 7:2", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 7, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Amos 7:5", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 7, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Gen 22:2", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 22, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Isa 7:3", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 7, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Isa 47:12", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 47, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Job 40:10", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 40, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Num 12:13", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 12, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Gen 40:14", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 40, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Gen 19:8", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 19, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Gen 19:20", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 19, "verse": 20}, {"r